Cross Point, wharf repairs, $3,030; Desjardins, wharf repairs, $765;

Supply-Public Works
East Templeton, wharf repairs, $1,420; Fabre, wharf repairs, $600; Father Point, wharf improvements, $5,500; Fassett, wharf repairs, $2,000; Fort William, wharf repairs, $950; Fox river, wharf repairs, $1,900; Grindstone, wharf repairs, shed repairs and breastwork extension, $2,050; Grand Mechins, wharf repairs, $1,350; Grosse Isle, wharf, repairs, $1,250; Iberville, wharf repairs, $850; Lanoraie, wharf reconstruction, $5,500; Lavaltrie, reconstruction of wharf and approach, $2,300; L'lslet, wharf repairs, $23,500.
